docs {
  # Implementation of the OTLP/HTTP protocol for logs ingest.

  This endpoint can be targeted by OpenTelemetry log exporters.

  This endpoint accepts arbitrary query parameters, which are processed as log attribute key-value pairs and added to each ingested log record following the standard rules for log attributes.

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `openpipeline:logs:ingest`, `storage:logs:write`

  **API token scopes:** logs.ingest
}
